Source code
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The complete corresponding source code for this program is published at:

    https://github.com/MarcosQuirogaR/ALAS

Section 13 of the AGPL applies to this program. ALAS runs a local HTTP server
(the analysis sidecar) that the desktop shell talks to. That server is bound to
the loopback interface and is not a network service in normal use -- but anyone
who does make an ALAS instance reachable over a network must offer its users
the corresponding source of their modified version.


